@host = http://localhost:5194

### Get all workouts
GET {{host}}/workouts

### Create a new workout
POST {{host}}/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise": "Bench press",
  "sets": 3,
  "reps": 10,
  "weightKg": 60
}

### Get a single workout
GET {{host}}/workouts/1

### Delete a workout
DELETE {{host}}/workouts/1